OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatchy cloud and isolated
OL,6,Fshowers to start, with hill fog over
OL,7,Fhigh ground. Showers slowly dying out
OL,8,Fto leave a dry afternoon with sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,10,Fsunshine with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FHeavy rain and low cloud
OL,13,Fpushes northeastwards with Storm
OL,14,FAusten. Windy for a time during the
OL,15,Fearly hours the easing briefly towards
OL,16,Fdawn.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FOutbreaks of heavy and
OL,19,Fpersistent rain continue to move
OL,20,Fnortheastwards through the day. Winds
OL,21,Fquickly picking up through the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
