OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FStrong
OL,6,Fwinds and heavy rain Saturday before a
OL,7,Fbrief settled interlude brings sunny
OL,8,Fspells and isolated light showers on
OL,9,FSunday. Further wind and rain arrives
OL,10,Fovernight into Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
